OL,3,ACarney faces crucial test after walking
OL,4,Aaway from Trump's deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is one of the first world leaders to
OL,7,Fwalk away from the negotiating table
OL,8,Fwith the White House - and the outcome
OL,9,Fwill be closely watched.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
