OL,3,AFourteen killed in strike on Myanmar
OL,4,Amonastery
OL,5,
OL,6,FFourteen people were killed in military
OL,7,Fair strikes at a monastery in Myanmar
OL,8,Fearly on Friday, opposition fighters
OL,9,Fand a local rescue worker have said.
OL,11,FAll of those killed were elderly and a
OL,12,Fnumber of monks were also injured, the
OL,13,Frescue worker told BBC Burmese, adding
OL,14,Fthat the site was struck twice.
OL,16,FThe attack happened at around 09:00
OL,17,Flocal time (02:30 GMT) in Myaung
OL,18,Ftownship in the central Sagaing region,
OL,19,Fsome 70km (47 miles) west of Mandalay,
OL,20,Fthe news agency AFP reported.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
